        (182, 'Curiosity | Textbook of Science | Grade 6', 8.0, 'NotoSerif-Italic', False, 7752849, 51.7, 523.3, 63.2, 677.8),
        (182, '164', 11.0, 'NotoSans-SemiBold', True, 16777215, 48.3, 703.2, 67.2, 719.2),
        (182, 'They go around the house to see the fields and the', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 172.2, 64.5, 524.6, 81.3),
        (182, 'cattle. To keep them busy, Nani gives them a challenge of', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 154.2, 80.5, 524.6, 99.2),
        (182, 'handpicking small stones from grains while keeping their', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 154.2, 96.5, 524.6, 113.4),
        (182, 'eyes closed.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 154.2, 112.5, 226.7, 129.4),
        (182, 'The method of picking by hand from a mixture (when', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 172.2, 128.3, 524.6, 147.2),
        (182, 'two or more substances are mixed) such as small stones and', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 154.2, 144.5, 524.6, 161.4),
        (182, 'husk from wheat and rice is called handpicking. It is done', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 154.2, 160.3, 524.6, 179.2),
        (182, 'on the basis of differences in size, colour and', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 226.2, 176.5, 524.6, 193.4),
        (182, 'shape of the particles. If the particles to be', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 241.2, 192.5, 524.6, 209.4),
        (182, 'removed are present in small quantities and', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 243.2, 208.5, 524.6, 225.4),
        (182, 'can easily be picked by hand, handpicking', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 245.2, 224.5, 524.6, 241.4),
        (182, 'proves to be a convenient method.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 245.2, 240.5, 461.8, 257.4),
        (182, 'At lunch, Malli and Valli are served', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 264.2, 256.5, 524.6, 273.3),
        (182, 'steaming', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 247.2, 272.5, 307.1, 289.3),
        (182, 'hot', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 319.4, 272.5, 343.1, 289.3),
        (182, 'vegetable', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 355.3, 272.5, 418.0, 289.3),
        (182, 'pulao.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 430.2, 272.5, 472.0, 289.3),
        (182, 'While', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 484.2, 272.5, 524.6, 289.3),
        (182, 'eating the pulao, Nani observes that', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 248.2, 288.5, 524.6, 307.2),
        (182, 'Malli is separating whole black peppers', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 244.2, 304.5, 524.6, 321.4),
        (182, 'from the pulao and is placing them', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 240.2, 320.5, 524.6, 337.4),
        (182, 'aside on his plate (Fig. 9.1). Valli playfully teases,', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 226.6, 336.5, 524.6, 353.4),
        (182, '“Wow! This is a handpicking method, nice one!”', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 226.6, 352.5, 524.6, 369.4),
        (182, 'Nani tells them about the benefits of black pepper and', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 154.2, 368.5, 524.6, 387.2),
        (182, 'encourages Malli to eat it.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 154.2, 384.5, 316.2, 401.4),
        (182, 'Later in the day, their Mama takes them to the fields', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 172.2, 400.5, 524.6, 419.2),
        (182, 'where they observe bundles of harvested', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 226.2, 416.3, 524.6, 435.2),
        (182, 'wheat stalks lying in the fields. Some', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 276.2, 432.5, 524.6, 449.4),
        (182, 'stalks are spread in the sun for drying.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 280.2, 448.5, 524.6, 465.4),
        (182, 'Both of them pick up a stalk each and', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 280.2, 464.5, 524.6, 481.4),
        (182, 'notice numerous grains attached to it. A', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 270.2, 480.5, 524.6, 497.4),
        (182, 'group of farmers are beating the stalks', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 269.2, 496.5, 524.6, 513.4),
        (182, 'on a large wooden log. Curiously, Valli', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 278.2, 512.5, 524.6, 529.4),
        (182, 'asks Mama, “Why are they doing this?”', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 280.2, 528.5, 524.6, 547.2),
        (182, 'Mama explains, “They are beating', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 297.2, 544.5, 524.6, 563.2),
        (182, 'the stalks to separate the grains” (Fig.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 270.2, 560.5, 524.6, 577.4),
        (182, '9.2). This process of separating grains', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 260.2, 576.5, 524.6, 593.4),
        (182, 'from the stalks is known as', 13.0, 'NotoSerif', False, 2301728, 246.2, 592.5, 446.6, 609.4),
