        (6, 'LET’S EXPLORE', 14.0, 'NotoSans-Bold', True, 16777215, 165.0, 376.8, 265.9, 397.3),
        (7, '33', 11.25, 'NotoSans-Bold', True, 16777215, 528.0, 698.6, 541.0, 715.0),
        (7, '2 – Oceans and Continents', 8.0, 'NotoSans-SemiBold', True, 2301728, 529.5, 580.4, 541.2, 684.6),
        (7, 'DON’T MISS OUT', 14.0, 'NotoSans-Bold', True, 16777215, 76.8, 67.8, 193.2, 88.2),
        (7, '\x93 As the map of oceans makes clear, the main limits of the', 12.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 75.0, 97.2, 438.1, 114.4),
        (7, 'Indian Ocean are Asia to the north, Africa to the west and', 12.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 100.2, 115.2, 438.1, 132.4),
        (7, 'Australia to the east, apart from the Southern Ocean in the', 12.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 100.2, 133.2, 438.1, 150.4),
        (7, 'south.', 12.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 100.2, 151.2, 135.3, 168.4),
        (7, '\x93 On either side of India, we find two parts of the Indian', 12.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 75.0, 173.7, 438.1, 190.9),
        (7, 'Ocean — the Arabian Sea to the west and the Bay of Bengal', 12.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 100.2, 191.7, 438.1, 208.9),
        (7, 'to the east.', 12.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 100.2, 209.7, 162.3, 226.9),
        (7, 'Fig. 2.4 (on the right). This map of India is', 10.0, 'NotoSerif-MediumItalic', False, 5790043, 84.4, 258.4, 286.2, 272.8),
        (7, 'the same as Fig. 1.6, but with the addition of', 10.0, 'NotoSerif-MediumItalic', False, 5790043, 73.5, 270.4, 286.2, 284.8),
        (7, 'the Arabian Sea and the Bay of Bengal. Also', 10.0, 'NotoSerif-MediumItalic', False, 5790043, 75.3, 282.4, 286.2, 296.8),
        (7, 'marked are India’s two major groups', 10.0, 'NotoSerif-MediumItalic', False, 5790043, 105.9, 294.4, 286.2, 308.8),
        (7, 'of islands (see subsection on ‘Islands’', 10.0, 'NotoSerif-MediumItalic', False, 5790043, 106.1, 306.4, 286.2, 320.8),
        (7, 'further below).', 10.0, 'NotoSerif-MediumItalic', False, 5790043, 212.1, 318.4, 283.6, 332.8),
        (7, 'Oceans and disasters', 15.0, 'NotoSerif-Bold', True, 15885127, 67.8, 337.3, 228.8, 359.1),
        (7, 'Returning to the picture of the', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 362.3, 287.0, 381.0),
        (7, 'Earth at the start of this chapter,', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 380.5, 287.0, 399.2),
        (7, 'you may have noticed white', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 398.7, 287.0, 417.4),
        (7, 'shapes across the globe. Did you', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 416.9, 287.0, 435.5),
        (7, 'guess what they are? They are', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 435.1, 287.0, 453.7),
        (7, 'large masses of clouds. Such clouds', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 453.2, 287.0, 471.9),
        (7, 'bring rain to the continents; for', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 471.4, 287.0, 490.1),
        (7, 'instance, the monsoon rains we', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 489.6, 287.0, 508.3),
        (7, 'in India expect every summer', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 507.8, 287.0, 526.5),
        (7, 'originate in the ocean — without', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 526.0, 287.0, 544.7),
        (7, 'such rains, our agriculture and all life will suffer. But oceans', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 544.2, 438.4, 562.9),
        (7, 'often also give rise to storms — violent events with extreme', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 562.4, 438.4, 581.0),
        (7, 'rainfall or very strong winds, such as cyclones, which can', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 580.5, 438.4, 599.2),
        (7, 'cause widespread damage to coastal regions of the world.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 598.7, 431.2, 617.4),
        (7, 'A tsunami is another natural disaster that originates in the', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 621.4, 438.4, 640.1),
        (7, 'ocean. It is a huge and powerful wave generally caused by', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 639.6, 438.3, 658.3),
        (7, 'a strong earthquake or a volcanic eruption at the bottom', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 657.8, 438.4, 676.5),
        (7, 'of the ocean. Tsunamis can travel thousands of kilometres', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 676.0, 438.4, 694.7),
        (7, 'and submerge coastal areas, causing widespread damage.', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 67.8, 694.2, 431.8, 712.9),
