        (206, 'This figure has lines of two different unit lengths. Measure the', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 89.4, 94.4, 501.4, 111.3),
        (206, 'lengths of a red line and a blue line; are they same? We will call the', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 71.4, 112.4, 501.4, 129.3),
        (206, 'red lines — straight lines and the blue lines — diagonal lines. So, the', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 71.4, 130.4, 501.4, 147.3),
        (206, 'perimeter of this triangle is 6 straight units + 3 diagonal units. We', 13.0, 'NotoSerif-Regular', False, 2301728, 71.5, 148.4, 501.5, 165.3),
